1
00:00:48,900 --> 00:00:50,460
(Shen Teng)

2
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:53,060
(Bai Jingting)

3
00:00:53,380 --> 00:00:55,260
(Jia Bing)

4
00:00:55,580 --> 00:00:57,340
(Hu Xianxu)

5
00:00:59,940 --> 00:01:01,820
(Wang Anyu)

6
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:04,100
(Fan Chengcheng)

7
00:01:04,460 --> 00:01:06,340
(Huang Jingyu)

8
00:01:06,460 --> 00:01:08,380
(Wang Churan)

9
00:01:08,580 --> 00:01:10,420
(Song Yaxuan)

10
00:01:11,140 --> 00:01:15,860
=Natural High S4=

11
00:01:25,740 --> 00:01:28,980
=EP6 (Part 1): Beneath the Great Wall=

12
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:30,240
Morning, Bing.

13
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,040
Is this Teng's song?

14
00:01:35,040 --> 00:01:36,120
It's Zhou Shen's.

15
00:01:36,120 --> 00:01:37,160
(Playing: Zhou Shen's
"The Great Dream Returns")

16
00:01:37,160 --> 00:01:38,280
Our voices do sound alike.

17
00:01:38,460 --> 00:01:39,200
(You're certainly not modest)

18
00:01:39,200 --> 00:01:40,360
When you hit the high notes?

19
00:01:40,360 --> 00:01:41,280
No, when we're asleep.

20
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:43,720
Even our snores sound alike.

21
00:01:46,520 --> 00:01:47,800
Bai.

22
00:01:47,800 --> 00:01:48,320
No, not that.

23
00:01:48,320 --> 00:01:49,560
Bai.

24
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:50,560
I'm here.

25
00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:51,280
(Your personal AI assistant
is now online)

26
00:01:51,280 --> 00:01:52,440
Bai, can you...

27
00:01:52,440 --> 00:01:53,680
The one behind me

28
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:54,520
keeps hinting at me.

29
00:01:54,700 --> 00:01:55,900
Got it.

30
00:01:55,940 --> 00:01:58,720
(Playing: Fan Chengcheng's "GTA")

31
00:01:58,720 --> 00:01:59,760
♪Let's start the game♪

32
00:01:59,760 --> 00:02:01,240
♪A suit and a white top hat♪

33
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:03,960
♪Don't tell me what to do♪

34
00:02:03,960 --> 00:02:05,240
You can't listen unless you're a member.

35
00:02:05,240 --> 00:02:06,520
So we can only hear half the song?

36
00:02:06,720 --> 00:02:09,000
Does he need a membership
to listen to his songs?

37
00:02:09,060 --> 00:02:10,280
(What's that supposed to mean?)
It's not my rule.

38
00:02:10,280 --> 00:02:11,490
(Disclaimer)
I mean.

39
00:02:11,520 --> 00:02:12,800
Everything I have is free.

40
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:13,760
The platform sets those rules, right?

41
00:02:13,760 --> 00:02:14,280
Right.

42
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:16,640
Why could we listen that day, then?

43
00:02:16,640 --> 00:02:18,040
We talked to the platform that day.

44
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:22,320
Bing, should we set up
a Manchu hot pot tomorrow?

45
00:02:22,320 --> 00:02:22,680
Sure.

46
00:02:23,640 --> 00:02:25,400
I'll make some dumplings tomorrow.

47
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:27,080
Let's make some big,
stuffed steamed dumplings.

48
00:02:27,080 --> 00:02:29,240
How about dumplings stuffed
with ribs and green beans?

49
00:02:30,200 --> 00:02:30,800
I've never seen

50
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:33,600
anyone put ribs and green beans
in dumplings.

51
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:36,400
(From Season 4, EP 5)
Green bean and pork rib buns.

52
00:02:36,420 --> 00:02:37,760
(A fan of ribs and green bean filling)

53
00:02:37,760 --> 00:02:38,760
Who's been to the Great Wall?

54
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:41,360
You haven't even been there?

55
00:02:41,360 --> 00:02:42,960
I have.

56
00:02:42,960 --> 00:02:44,240
This has the better view,

57
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:44,680
right?

58
00:02:45,480 --> 00:02:46,080
The scenery is great.

59
00:02:46,480 --> 00:02:48,640
There's a lot more greenery around here.

60
00:02:49,020 --> 00:02:50,620
(Some serious excitement building)

61
00:02:50,660 --> 00:02:51,720
(Arriving at Mutianyu Great Wall)

62
00:02:51,720 --> 00:02:52,360
We're here.

63
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:54,040
Let's go.

64
00:02:54,680 --> 00:02:55,280
Come on.

65
00:02:55,280 --> 00:02:56,160
Let's take the cable car.

66
00:02:56,700 --> 00:02:57,860
I can't do this.

67
00:02:57,860 --> 00:02:59,540
You can't handle an enclosed cable car?

68
00:02:59,540 --> 00:03:00,060
Are you scared?

69
00:03:00,060 --> 00:03:00,940
Just close your eyes and get on.

70
00:03:00,940 --> 00:03:02,140
Go, go, go.

71
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:04,310
I'm exhausted.

72
00:03:04,310 --> 00:03:04,940
I'm speechless.

73
00:03:04,940 --> 00:03:05,440
I'm giving up.

74
00:03:05,440 --> 00:03:05,860
I'm hopeless.

75
00:03:05,860 --> 00:03:06,330
I'm having a breakdown.

76
00:03:06,820 --> 00:03:07,490
It's beautiful.

77
00:03:07,490 --> 00:03:08,040
Chengcheng.

78
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:09,490
Look outside.

79
00:03:10,030 --> 00:03:10,730
(Refusing)
It's beautiful.

80
00:03:11,280 --> 00:03:12,160
Look, what's that?

81
00:03:12,160 --> 00:03:12,760
Over there.

82
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:13,640
Look this way.

83
00:03:13,640 --> 00:03:14,360
(What?)
What is that?

84
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:15,200
(Teng)
Wang Churan.

85
00:03:15,200 --> 00:03:16,080
(I'm too scared to mess with you guys)
Teng's saying hi to you.

86
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:18,400
(Intern)
It says "Intern".

87
00:03:18,860 --> 00:03:20,620
(Keep your mouth shut)
"Intern Cable Car".

88
00:03:21,220 --> 00:03:22,420
(The only reliable source)

89
00:03:23,200 --> 00:03:24,660
(Kids these days are sensitive)
Please don't move. Please.

90
00:03:25,380 --> 00:03:29,060
(Daily skincare
for a stylish guy over 40)

91
00:03:30,080 --> 00:03:31,320
There. Turn around and you'll see it.

92
00:03:34,060 --> 00:03:35,580
(The Great Wall)

93
00:03:35,600 --> 00:03:36,240
You bet.

94
00:03:36,240 --> 00:03:36,960
Of course it's the Great Wall.

95
00:03:37,800 --> 00:03:39,400
The view behind you is really beautiful.

96
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:44,960
Beautiful.

97
00:03:47,680 --> 00:03:49,080
It's truly spectacular.

98
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:49,560
It really is.

99
00:03:52,960 --> 00:03:54,000
Magnificent.

100
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:55,400
A journey to the Great Wall
makes a hero.

101
00:03:55,400 --> 00:03:56,480
We're finally here.

102
00:03:56,480 --> 00:03:57,720
This beats climbing all the way up.

103
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,880
It would've taken all afternoon
to get here.

104
00:04:00,680 --> 00:04:02,120
Filming our climb

105
00:04:02,120 --> 00:04:03,520
would've taken
at least three videotapes.

106
00:04:03,520 --> 00:04:06,660
(A rather old-school way of putting it)

107
00:04:07,560 --> 00:04:07,920
Let's go.

108
00:04:10,620 --> 00:04:12,540
(So close to holding hands)

109
00:04:13,320 --> 00:04:14,680
That was a pretty slick turn.

110
00:04:14,680 --> 00:04:15,400
Didn't get to use it.

111
00:04:16,950 --> 00:04:17,600
Are we here?

112
00:04:17,600 --> 00:04:17,950
We're here.

113
00:04:17,950 --> 00:04:19,720
(Making a quick escape)
Quick!

114
00:04:19,830 --> 00:04:20,240
He's scared.

115
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:22,280
He's afraid of riding the cable car.

116
00:04:23,120 --> 00:04:24,280
What's there to be scared of?

117
00:04:24,280 --> 00:04:25,440
That really freaked him out.

118
00:04:27,320 --> 00:04:28,160
It's fine. No big deal.

119
00:04:28,180 --> 00:04:29,340
(Putting on a brave face)

120
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:31,640
And there's the sun.

121
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:34,160
I thought they were following Bai.

122
00:04:34,760 --> 00:04:36,480
"Village chief" Mr. Bai
from Huairou, Beijing.

123
00:04:36,580 --> 00:04:37,780
(Last episode's running gag lives on)

124
00:04:38,640 --> 00:04:39,720
Gracing the Great Wall
with his presence.

125
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:43,400
Are we just pretending
we climbed all the way up here?

126
00:04:44,080 --> 00:04:45,320
Yep, pretending.

127
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:48,200
You can play the game later.

128
00:04:48,200 --> 00:04:49,360
I'm going to climb the Great Wall.

129
00:04:49,460 --> 00:04:51,100
(He's got the Great Wall on his mind)

130
00:04:51,320 --> 00:04:52,920
A journey to the Great Wall
makes a hero.

131
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:53,880
Take a picture of me.

132
00:04:54,140 --> 00:04:56,460
(Making sure the trip
wasn't for nothing)

133
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:58,480
Okay.

134
00:04:58,480 --> 00:04:59,760
The Hero's Monument is up ahead.

135
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:02,280
Why are you
taking so many pictures here?

136
00:05:02,500 --> 00:05:04,340
(Even the local
is impressed by his creativity)

137
00:05:04,600 --> 00:05:05,440
Teng, look at this.

138
00:05:09,300 --> 00:05:10,180
(Look in my eyes)

139
00:05:10,220 --> 00:05:12,060
(And that's one giant close-up)

140
00:05:12,720 --> 00:05:13,760
I came all the way to the Great Wall,

141
00:05:13,760 --> 00:05:14,680
and all you give me is a close-up?

142
00:05:16,220 --> 00:05:17,900
(I have no words)

143
00:05:17,980 --> 00:05:19,420
(Determined to get the perfect shot)

144
00:05:19,460 --> 00:05:21,420
(Here we go again)

145
00:05:21,860 --> 00:05:22,560
(Trembling lips)

146
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:23,000
Okay.

147
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:25,480
Why are you smiling like that?

148
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:25,920
Right here.

149
00:05:26,200 --> 00:05:27,040
I'm acting like I'm exhausted.

150
00:05:30,200 --> 00:05:31,280
Look at the picture he took.

151
00:05:31,280 --> 00:05:32,520
I'm changing my Weibo profile picture.

152
00:05:35,840 --> 00:05:37,520
Here's a new profile picture
for everyone.

153
00:05:38,780 --> 00:05:40,260
(A profile picture
that's impossible to miss)

154
00:05:40,920 --> 00:05:43,120
What's that "yellow thing"?

155
00:05:44,860 --> 00:05:46,140
(Song Yaxuan)
He's here.

156
00:05:47,560 --> 00:05:48,240
Let's give a warm welcome

157
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:50,320
to the most random little guy.

158
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:51,800
Song!

159
00:05:55,620 --> 00:05:57,180
(Connection established)

160
00:05:57,520 --> 00:05:58,960
Hello.

161
00:05:58,960 --> 00:06:01,280
Did you climb all the way up here?

162
00:06:01,460 --> 00:06:03,540
(Long time no see)

163
00:06:06,560 --> 00:06:07,640
Why does it feel like
you've gotten even taller?

164
00:06:08,320 --> 00:06:09,160
How are you so tall?

165
00:06:11,120 --> 00:06:12,160
You're not wearing lifts, are you?

166
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:13,640
Nope.

167
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:15,600
Who'd actually admit to wearing lifts?

168
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:16,720
Do you think just asking

169
00:06:16,720 --> 00:06:18,040
(Seriously)
will get you an answer?

170
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,560
Isn't that how you look for the "wolf"?

171
00:06:19,620 --> 00:06:20,620
(That's actually a good point)

172
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:23,240
Everyone,

173
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:24,440
we're now

174
00:06:24,440 --> 00:06:26,440
at the Mutianyu Great Wall.

175
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:26,920
(Located in Huairou, Beijing)
It's known

176
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:28,280
(A key defense for centuries)
as the finest section

177
00:06:28,280 --> 00:06:28,920
of the Great Wall.

178
00:06:29,600 --> 00:06:31,560
It's one of the best-preserved

179
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:33,000
and most iconic sections

180
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:35,560
of China's Ming-era Great Wall.

181
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:36,320
(Spring)
The Great Wall

182
00:06:36,320 --> 00:06:38,000
(Summer)
is one of the Seven Wonders.

183
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:38,540
(Autumn)

184
00:06:38,580 --> 00:06:40,160
(Winter)
It was added

185
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:41,600
to the UNESCO World Heritage List

186
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:43,080
in 1987.

187
00:06:43,840 --> 00:06:45,640
Let's welcome our tour guide, Dong He,

188
00:06:45,640 --> 00:06:46,960
who'll show us around the Great Wall.

189
00:06:47,440 --> 00:06:48,680
Alright, let's welcome Mr. Dong.

190
00:06:48,960 --> 00:06:50,040
Hi, sir.

191
00:06:50,040 --> 00:06:51,480
Welcome to the Mutianyu Great Wall.

192
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:52,600
(Official tour guide)
I'll be your tour guide today.

193
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:53,800
My name is Dong He.

194
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:55,520
I'll be taking everyone

195
00:06:55,520 --> 00:06:56,840
on a tour
of the Mutianyu Great Wall today.

196
00:06:56,840 --> 00:06:57,240
Okay.

197
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:58,560
Come on, let's take this path.

198
00:07:00,180 --> 00:07:01,340
(A friendly greeting)

199
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:02,120
What?

200
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:03,800
Why'd you kick me?

201
00:07:04,920 --> 00:07:06,200
That was a quick outfit change.

202
00:07:06,200 --> 00:07:06,800
It's so cold.

203
00:07:07,960 --> 00:07:09,400
Here, let's take this path.

204
00:07:09,400 --> 00:07:10,280
We'll make our way up the Great Wall.

205
00:07:10,480 --> 00:07:11,680
First, let's head over to this spot.

206
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:13,520
This is beautiful.

207
00:07:14,700 --> 00:07:15,860
=Natural High S4=

208
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:18,360
Isn't the elevation a little high?

209
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:19,600
Why am I kinda out of breath?

210
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:20,360
It's not even that high.

211
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:21,280
I'm out of breath
after just a few steps.

212
00:07:21,840 --> 00:07:23,000
How high up are we

213
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:23,480
now?

214
00:07:23,720 --> 00:07:24,960
Are you getting altitude sickness, Teng?

215
00:07:24,960 --> 00:07:25,480
I'm not.

216
00:07:26,680 --> 00:07:27,600
600 meters.

217
00:07:28,400 --> 00:07:30,140
(Taking back his claim)
I'm fine.

218
00:07:30,620 --> 00:07:32,140
(Actually, he's got plenty of energy)

219
00:07:35,160 --> 00:07:36,080
Come on, hurry up.

220
00:07:39,100 --> 00:07:40,340
(What are you doing?)

221
00:07:43,880 --> 00:07:44,960
Come on, let's take a look.

222
00:07:44,960 --> 00:07:46,360
One of the unique features
of the Mutianyu Great Wall

223
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:46,880
is its battlements

224
00:07:46,900 --> 00:07:48,020
on both sides.

225
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:48,440
These

226
00:07:49,320 --> 00:07:50,200
are called "she kong".
[*Arrow slits]

227
00:07:51,320 --> 00:07:52,310
"She kong".
[*Arrow slits]

228
00:07:52,310 --> 00:07:55,000
That's me. "She kong".
[*Social anxiety]

229
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:55,880
Next.

230
00:07:55,880 --> 00:07:56,480
This is

231
00:07:56,880 --> 00:07:59,000
a very important structure
on the Great Wall.

232
00:07:59,000 --> 00:07:59,520
It's called

233
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:00,640
a watchtower.

234
00:08:00,640 --> 00:08:01,760
It was used to observe enemy movements

235
00:08:01,760 --> 00:08:03,080
and store food and ammunition.

236
00:08:03,360 --> 00:08:04,440
We're going inside the watchtower.

237
00:08:07,960 --> 00:08:08,880
It's a little dark in here,

238
00:08:08,880 --> 00:08:10,080
but let's take a quick look.

239
00:08:10,080 --> 00:08:11,880
There are lots
of arched structures inside.

240
00:08:18,560 --> 00:08:19,920
These arches provide excellent support

241
00:08:19,920 --> 00:08:21,280
for the weight above,

242
00:08:21,280 --> 00:08:22,360
which is why they were used
in the construction.

243
00:08:25,900 --> 00:08:28,100
(What a coincidence)

244
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:29,760
See all those rocks in the distance?

245
00:08:29,760 --> 00:08:31,640
That's the only beacon tower here.

246
00:08:31,840 --> 00:08:32,480
Which one?

247
00:08:32,480 --> 00:08:33,120
Over there.

248
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:35,270
(Beacon tower)
That spot with all the rocks over there.

249
00:08:35,280 --> 00:08:36,670
I mean,

250
00:08:36,670 --> 00:08:38,280
the Great Wall is so high up.

251
00:08:38,280 --> 00:08:38,840
Did they come all the way up here

252
00:08:38,840 --> 00:08:40,240
to fight battles back then?

253
00:08:40,880 --> 00:08:42,280
Yeah. Since this section
of the Great Wall

254
00:08:42,280 --> 00:08:43,480
is so high up in the mountains,

255
00:08:43,480 --> 00:08:45,160
there weren't many battles here.

256
00:08:45,160 --> 00:08:46,280
So, did any battles

257
00:08:46,280 --> 00:08:48,520
actually take place here?

258
00:08:48,520 --> 00:08:49,840
Yes, but not many.

259
00:08:49,840 --> 00:08:51,320
It would take the enemy quite a while

260
00:08:51,320 --> 00:08:53,160
just to climb all the way up here.

261
00:08:53,800 --> 00:08:54,720
They'd give up before reaching the top.

262
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:56,120
They'd surrender.

263
00:08:56,560 --> 00:08:57,960
Why don't you go down
and try "attacking" me?

264
00:08:58,340 --> 00:08:59,380
(Just kidding)

265
00:09:00,960 --> 00:09:01,800
There's always a higher peak.

266
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:03,320
And another city beyond that.

267
00:09:03,560 --> 00:09:04,200
Fan "Chengcheng".
[*City]

268
00:09:04,580 --> 00:09:05,860
(He's really mastered the art of puns)

269
00:09:07,400 --> 00:09:08,280
Chengcheng, great.

270
00:09:08,280 --> 00:09:09,000
Yeah.

271
00:09:09,880 --> 00:09:11,760
This kid just loves taking pictures
with the Great Wall.

272
00:09:12,520 --> 00:09:13,400
He's been doing it

273
00:09:13,400 --> 00:09:13,800
the whole way here.

274
00:09:13,800 --> 00:09:14,960
I told him I wanted to listen
to the tour guide,

275
00:09:14,960 --> 00:09:15,440
but he wouldn't have it.

276
00:09:15,440 --> 00:09:16,800
He insisted that I take pictures of him.

277
00:09:16,800 --> 00:09:17,520
He's having the time of his life.

278
00:09:18,040 --> 00:09:18,760
So happy.

279
00:09:18,760 --> 00:09:19,840
You can stop it now.

280
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:29,320
Is this a close-up?

281
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:30,320
All you got was your eyes.

282
00:09:30,940 --> 00:09:32,780
(Just as expected)

283
00:09:35,060 --> 00:09:37,220
(Take a picture of me, will you?)

284
00:09:39,220 --> 00:09:40,700
(Let's take a selfie)

285
00:09:42,260 --> 00:09:43,860
(Thought you were taking one of me)

286
00:09:47,680 --> 00:09:48,840
Just use your own phone.

287
00:09:49,160 --> 00:09:50,040
What kind of shot do you want?

288
00:09:50,460 --> 00:09:52,420
(Like this)

289
00:09:53,600 --> 00:09:54,240
This one looks good.

290
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:55,600
Are you done?

291
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:58,040
It looks like
my head's been chopped off.

292
00:09:59,780 --> 00:10:03,460
(Feel free
to add your own background music)

293
00:10:05,440 --> 00:10:06,720
And

294
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:08,320
turn around just a little.

295
00:10:12,320 --> 00:10:12,800
That's good.

296
00:10:12,800 --> 00:10:13,840
This one looks really good.

297
00:10:15,600 --> 00:10:16,560
This is so cool.

298
00:10:17,160 --> 00:10:17,880
We got the shot.

299
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:19,960
Take one of Bing.

300
00:10:20,360 --> 00:10:20,800
Perfect timing.

301
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:22,000
Teng, stay where you are.

302
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:22,360
Don't move.

303
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:23,480
Step back a little.

304
00:10:28,600 --> 00:10:29,760
I think this one looks the coolest.

305
00:10:29,760 --> 00:10:30,080
This one.

306
00:10:31,040 --> 00:10:31,760
And this one.

307
00:10:31,760 --> 00:10:33,100
(Enough to imagine an entire epic drama)

308
00:10:36,480 --> 00:10:36,960
Okay.

309
00:10:36,960 --> 00:10:37,920
Let's touch up the top a little.

310
00:10:40,320 --> 00:10:41,680
He's actually really happy with it.

311
00:10:42,520 --> 00:10:44,800
He's just pretending he doesn't like it.

312
00:10:45,680 --> 00:10:47,160
Three, two, one.

313
00:10:48,240 --> 00:10:49,000
Were you climbing?

314
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:51,040
Bai, were you climbing

315
00:10:51,040 --> 00:10:51,920
just now?

316
00:10:51,920 --> 00:10:52,720
No, I wasn't.

317
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:53,840
This feels like an interrogation.

318
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:55,160
Were you climbing just now?

319
00:10:56,060 --> 00:10:58,280
(October 2026,
our time on the Great Wall)

320
00:10:58,280 --> 00:10:58,680
Let's do this.

321
00:10:58,680 --> 00:10:59,640
Let's take a picture

322
00:10:59,640 --> 00:11:00,840
where we're up on the Great Wall,

323
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:02,480
and Teng is down below us.

324
00:11:03,240 --> 00:11:04,840
Are we supposed
to look like we're under attack?

325
00:11:05,360 --> 00:11:06,120
We can just

326
00:11:06,120 --> 00:11:07,520
hide our faces here.

327
00:11:07,520 --> 00:11:07,880
That's it.

328
00:11:07,880 --> 00:11:08,240
Okay.

329
00:11:09,920 --> 00:11:10,280
Wait,

330
00:11:10,280 --> 00:11:12,520
what if you stick the camera out

331
00:11:12,520 --> 00:11:13,400
from there,

332
00:11:13,400 --> 00:11:14,360
and then we each peek out from here,

333
00:11:14,360 --> 00:11:15,240
one by one?

334
00:11:15,760 --> 00:11:16,640
Isn't that how we should do it?

335
00:11:18,360 --> 00:11:18,960
Watch me.

336
00:11:21,080 --> 00:11:22,120
This is actually pretty fun.

337
00:11:22,320 --> 00:11:23,840
Who wants to take a picture over here?

338
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:25,000
Come on, look this way.

339
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:25,440
Come on.

340
00:11:27,240 --> 00:11:28,400
Let's all peek out one by one.

341
00:11:28,400 --> 00:11:28,880
Come on.

342
00:11:28,880 --> 00:11:29,520
Peek out.

343
00:11:29,520 --> 00:11:29,880
Let's go.

344
00:11:30,400 --> 00:11:30,640
Come on.

345
00:11:31,440 --> 00:11:32,280
One.

346
00:11:32,280 --> 00:11:33,160
Two.

347
00:11:33,160 --> 00:11:34,080
Three.

348
00:11:34,080 --> 00:11:34,960
Four.

349
00:11:34,960 --> 00:11:35,960
Five.

350
00:11:35,960 --> 00:11:36,800
Six.

351
00:11:36,800 --> 00:11:37,560
Seven.

352
00:11:41,880 --> 00:11:43,280
Doesn't it feel pretty inspiring?

353
00:11:45,760 --> 00:11:46,680
Let me give you

354
00:11:46,680 --> 00:11:47,560
a little push.

355
00:11:54,120 --> 00:11:54,840
This is great.

356
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:55,280
I'm telling you.

357
00:11:55,280 --> 00:11:55,880
It makes climbing so much easier.

358
00:11:57,320 --> 00:11:58,160
Give me a boost.

359
00:11:59,480 --> 00:12:00,560
I'll give you a boost.

360
00:12:08,080 --> 00:12:08,720
Stop pushing.

361
00:12:10,720 --> 00:12:11,600
Come on, let me help you.

362
00:12:13,200 --> 00:12:13,840
Come on.

363
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:15,480
Help you.

364
00:12:17,980 --> 00:12:19,320
(Two bodyguards on duty to protect Teng)

365
00:12:19,320 --> 00:12:20,240
You walk like...

366
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:21,720
Don't.

367
00:12:22,560 --> 00:12:23,680
He looks like a boss.

368
00:12:24,360 --> 00:12:24,840
Yeah.

369
00:12:28,540 --> 00:12:29,860
(Too funny to handle)

370
00:12:30,200 --> 00:12:32,240
I can barely find the steps
with my feet.

371
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:33,720
I've been crouching my way up
the whole time.

372
00:12:35,920 --> 00:12:37,280
I don't even want to reach the end.

373
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:39,200
Why don't you sleep here, Teng?

374
00:12:40,080 --> 00:12:41,840
Bring his tent over.

375
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:43,120
He can camp out
in the watchtower tonight.

376
00:12:45,280 --> 00:12:47,040
We've made it to the Great Wall.

377
00:12:48,280 --> 00:12:49,410
It's magnificent.

378
00:12:55,240 --> 00:12:58,120
♪We're someone special♪

379
00:12:58,120 --> 00:13:00,040
♪To each other♪

380
00:13:00,920 --> 00:13:02,560
You're dressed up

381
00:13:03,120 --> 00:13:04,280
like Noby.

382
00:13:04,280 --> 00:13:05,040
(The "baby" status is lifelong)

383
00:13:05,040 --> 00:13:05,960
The one from Doraemon.

384
00:13:05,960 --> 00:13:06,440
Really?

385
00:13:08,200 --> 00:13:08,960
What kind of fabric is this?

386
00:13:09,100 --> 00:13:11,280
(Rubbing)

387
00:13:11,280 --> 00:13:12,200
Wanna clean your glasses?

388
00:13:12,220 --> 00:13:14,660
(Figured out what he wanted
in zero seconds)

389
00:13:15,320 --> 00:13:16,000
Clever.

390
00:13:17,860 --> 00:13:19,220
(Thanks)

391
00:13:19,960 --> 00:13:20,920
How are your eyes?

392
00:13:20,920 --> 00:13:22,060
(There's a second challenge)
Help me put these in.

393
00:13:22,920 --> 00:13:23,680
Don't touch the front.

394
00:13:23,680 --> 00:13:24,960
I won't. Just keep your eyes open.

395
00:13:25,140 --> 00:13:27,720
(Leaning back)

396
00:13:27,720 --> 00:13:29,080
No, you don't have
to lean back that far.

397
00:13:29,080 --> 00:13:29,560
I...

398
00:13:29,560 --> 00:13:30,600
Didn't get any drops in.

399
00:13:31,800 --> 00:13:33,280
I can do this.

400
00:13:33,280 --> 00:13:34,200
Wang Churan is a pro

401
00:13:34,200 --> 00:13:34,560
at putting in eye drops.

402
00:13:34,560 --> 00:13:35,680
No, open your eyes a little wider.

403
00:13:35,680 --> 00:13:36,620
(Here comes the expert)

404
00:13:36,680 --> 00:13:37,040
Pull his eyelid open.

405
00:13:40,220 --> 00:13:41,940
(All three finally breathe
a sigh of relief)

406
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:43,400
Bad-boy charm.

407
00:13:43,500 --> 00:13:45,320
(Everyone here is in for a treat)

408
00:13:45,320 --> 00:13:45,520
Next up,

409
00:13:45,520 --> 00:13:47,360
we're moving on to our first mission.

410
00:13:47,360 --> 00:13:49,080
Let's welcome Dr. Chen

411
00:13:49,080 --> 00:13:50,680
to explain this topic

412
00:13:50,680 --> 00:13:51,720
to everyone.

413
00:13:52,360 --> 00:13:53,480
(Keeping the spark alive)
Dr. Chen.

414
00:13:53,480 --> 00:13:55,200
(Keeping the spark alive)
Hey, Song.

415
00:13:55,200 --> 00:13:56,320
It's been a while.

416
00:13:56,320 --> 00:13:57,960
(Chen Rui)
Alright, let me introduce you

417
00:13:57,960 --> 00:13:59,840
to a native Beijing ant species.

418
00:14:00,400 --> 00:14:02,160
(An ant species in the Formicidae family)
It's called Formica beijingensis.

419
00:14:02,160 --> 00:14:03,400
What's that?

420
00:14:03,400 --> 00:14:04,760
These ants are pretty amazing.

421
00:14:04,760 --> 00:14:05,680
(Formica beijingensis nest)
There are tens of thousands of ants

422
00:14:05,680 --> 00:14:06,920
(Huang Jingyu)
in a single nest.

423
00:14:06,920 --> 00:14:09,400
They work together
and divide up the tasks.

424
00:14:09,400 --> 00:14:10,400
Everyone has a clearly defined role.

425
00:14:10,400 --> 00:14:11,120
No matter

426
00:14:11,120 --> 00:14:13,160
(Wang Churan)
how crowded their space gets,

427
00:14:13,160 --> 00:14:14,240
or how chaotic things become,

428
00:14:14,240 --> 00:14:16,120
(Bai Jingting)
they can communicate with accuracy.

429
00:14:16,120 --> 00:14:17,240
The next mission is based

430
00:14:17,240 --> 00:14:19,080
on how these ants work.

431
00:14:19,080 --> 00:14:20,440
You have to stay calm

432
00:14:20,440 --> 00:14:21,480
despite all the noise,

433
00:14:21,480 --> 00:14:23,360
recognize teammates
through signals and eye contact,

434
00:14:23,360 --> 00:14:24,400
and pass on information.

435
00:14:24,400 --> 00:14:25,240
Sounds good.

436
00:14:25,240 --> 00:14:26,600
Alright, thanks, Dr. Chen.

437
00:14:28,720 --> 00:14:30,560
Chen's Mandarin

438
00:14:30,560 --> 00:14:32,120
hasn't changed at all in three years.

439
00:14:37,240 --> 00:14:37,840
Next,

440
00:14:37,840 --> 00:14:38,960
you'll be taking on the mission

441
00:14:38,960 --> 00:14:39,760
while dancing.

442
00:14:39,760 --> 00:14:40,560
Let me explain the rules.

443
00:14:40,880 --> 00:14:42,080
(Dance Party: Clueless Killer)
Among the eight players,

444
00:14:42,080 --> 00:14:43,320
six are Good Guys,

445
00:14:43,320 --> 00:14:44,680
(Six Good Guys, one Boss, one Killer)
one is the Boss,

446
00:14:44,680 --> 00:14:45,560
and one is the Killer.

447
00:14:45,560 --> 00:14:46,760
The Boss and Killer

448
00:14:46,760 --> 00:14:48,000
must recognize each other

449
00:14:48,000 --> 00:14:49,160
through a designated move.

450
00:14:49,160 --> 00:14:50,440
The Boss must secretly

451
00:14:50,440 --> 00:14:52,640
(Hu Xianxu)
tell the Killer who to target.

452
00:14:52,640 --> 00:14:54,040
(Boss: Secretly passes the target)
The Killer must identify the target

453
00:14:54,040 --> 00:14:55,280
(Killer: Identifies and eliminates)
and take them out.

454
00:14:55,280 --> 00:14:57,200
To take the target out, shout,

455
00:14:57,200 --> 00:14:59,120
(Attack method)
"Name, you're out!"

456
00:14:59,120 --> 00:15:02,400
(Shout the phrase at the target)
Each player wears three stickers.

457
00:15:02,400 --> 00:15:03,420
(Fan Chengcheng, removing all three stickers)
Shake off

458
00:15:03,420 --> 00:15:04,600
(cancels a bullet)
all the stickers by dancing.

459
00:15:04,600 --> 00:15:06,240
The Killer has four bullets.

460
00:15:06,240 --> 00:15:07,200
(Jia Bing)
Before the Good Guys

461
00:15:07,200 --> 00:15:08,920
remove all their stickers,

462
00:15:08,920 --> 00:15:10,560
the Killer must correctly
eliminate three targets.

463
00:15:10,560 --> 00:15:12,240
The Boss and Killer win if they succeed.

464
00:15:12,300 --> 00:15:13,240
(The Killer has four bullets)
Got it.

465
00:15:13,240 --> 00:15:14,640
(Three successful eliminations)
Otherwise, the Good Guys win.

466
00:15:14,640 --> 00:15:15,680
(And claim victory)
The Good Guys win

467
00:15:15,680 --> 00:15:17,680
if they vote out the Boss.

468
00:15:17,680 --> 00:15:19,280
But there's a twist this time.

469
00:15:19,280 --> 00:15:20,760
If the Killer picks the wrong target,

470
00:15:20,760 --> 00:15:21,400
the elimination doesn't count.

471
00:15:21,400 --> 00:15:22,520
The person they target

472
00:15:22,520 --> 00:15:23,280
will still be in the game.

473
00:15:23,920 --> 00:15:24,680
These stickers are hard to shake off.

474
00:15:25,160 --> 00:15:26,280
The crazier you dance, the better.

475
00:15:27,320 --> 00:15:28,000
Alright, let's do this.

476
00:15:28,440 --> 00:15:29,320
Time to draw your roles.

477
00:15:35,980 --> 00:15:36,780
(Dance Party: Clueless Killer Round 1)

478
00:15:36,800 --> 00:15:37,960
Everyone,

479
00:15:37,960 --> 00:15:39,320
close your eyes.

480
00:15:40,480 --> 00:15:43,200
Armed Killer, open your eyes.

481
00:15:45,500 --> 00:15:46,680
(Killer this round: Fan Chengcheng)

482
00:15:46,680 --> 00:15:48,400
Watch the secret signal.

483
00:15:48,400 --> 00:15:51,140
(Secret Signal: Showering freely)

484
00:15:53,960 --> 00:15:55,400
Boss, open your eyes.

485
00:15:57,180 --> 00:15:58,240
(Boss this round: Shen Teng)

486
00:15:58,240 --> 00:15:59,640
Watch the secret signal.

487
00:15:59,640 --> 00:16:00,520
(Secret Signal: Showering freely)

488
00:16:00,520 --> 00:16:03,040
(Target: Jia Bing)
Your first target.

489
00:16:09,160 --> 00:16:09,960
Open your eyes.

490
00:16:11,020 --> 00:16:13,900
(Secret Signal: Showering freely)

491
00:16:13,900 --> 00:16:15,640
(Boss: Shen Teng, Killer:
Fan Chengcheng, Target: Jia Bing)

492
00:16:15,640 --> 00:16:16,680
That was quick.

493
00:16:17,260 --> 00:16:18,620
(Eager, aren't you?)

494
00:16:18,660 --> 00:16:21,100
(Accidentally
draws everyone's attention)

495
00:16:24,500 --> 00:16:26,340
(Is Bai hinting at scrubbing?)

496
00:16:26,420 --> 00:16:27,340
(Is that you, Killer Bai?)

497
00:16:27,460 --> 00:16:29,220
(Bai's scrubbing himself?)

498
00:16:29,260 --> 00:16:31,220
(Teng mistakes Bai for Killer)

499
00:16:31,460 --> 00:16:34,740
(Are you Boss Bai?)

500
00:16:39,900 --> 00:16:41,540
(Secretly making the Secret Signal)

501
00:16:43,180 --> 00:16:45,780
(Signal not received)

502
00:16:45,860 --> 00:16:46,980
(Staring)

503
00:16:46,980 --> 00:16:48,540
(Completely oblivious,
lost in the dance)

504
00:16:54,020 --> 00:16:56,180
(Killer Bai,
turn on the shower to communicate)

505
00:17:00,940 --> 00:17:02,180
(Is he showering?)

506
00:17:02,200 --> 00:17:03,760
Better copy him now, just in case.

507
00:17:04,180 --> 00:17:08,260
(Copies him instantly)

508
00:17:08,340 --> 00:17:10,220
(Incredibly subtle)

509
00:17:10,820 --> 00:17:12,540
(Whispering, Jia Bing)

510
00:17:13,300 --> 00:17:14,780
(What are you mumbling about?)

511
00:17:19,580 --> 00:17:20,820
(Starts washing his hair)

512
00:17:20,820 --> 00:17:21,820
(Copies him)

513
00:17:22,820 --> 00:17:24,020
(Spots it instantly)

514
00:17:24,540 --> 00:17:26,580
(Another one washing his hair?)

515
00:17:27,920 --> 00:17:28,800
Why are you washing your hair?

516
00:17:31,240 --> 00:17:32,960
Isn't it supposed to be a shower theme?

517
00:17:32,960 --> 00:17:33,940
(Mr. Ye has cracked the code)

518
00:17:33,980 --> 00:17:34,980
Isn't it supposed to be a shower theme?

519
00:17:35,180 --> 00:17:36,500
(So it's you, Boss Song)

520
00:17:38,880 --> 00:17:40,280
What is he doing?

521
00:17:41,020 --> 00:17:43,220
(I'm a Locking boy)

522
00:17:50,980 --> 00:17:53,260
(What is Boss Song doing?)

523
00:17:53,280 --> 00:17:54,760
The signal can't be

524
00:17:54,760 --> 00:17:56,560
that hard, right?

525
00:17:57,380 --> 00:17:59,220
(Hard to figure out, but I'll try)

526
00:17:59,580 --> 00:18:01,620
(Waiting for Boss Song
to give the signal)

527
00:18:05,940 --> 00:18:08,220
(Something's off about Song)

528
00:18:11,540 --> 00:18:13,460
(Is Boss Song hinting
that Bai is the target?)

529
00:18:13,620 --> 00:18:15,420
(Target locked. Ready to strike)

530
00:18:16,340 --> 00:18:17,340
(Target starts scrubbing his back)

531
00:18:18,980 --> 00:18:20,420
(I knew it was you)

532
00:18:20,940 --> 00:18:22,620
(Wait, no)

533
00:18:22,660 --> 00:18:25,260
(Back and forth)

534
00:18:25,340 --> 00:18:26,420
(Chengcheng walks into the bathhouse)

535
00:18:26,420 --> 00:18:27,780
(The Good Guys
have set up an elaborate trap)

536
00:18:27,780 --> 00:18:29,060
(Hot Spring Huairou Branch)

537
00:18:29,100 --> 00:18:32,340
(The Killer's POV: Everyone's bathing,
washing, and scrubbing)

538
00:18:32,820 --> 00:18:35,380
(Wait, who's the boss?)

539
00:18:35,860 --> 00:18:37,900
(Why hasn't Bai made his move?)

540
00:18:38,540 --> 00:18:41,940
(Hinting at the secret signal again)

541
00:18:41,980 --> 00:18:43,740
(Copies him instantly)

542
00:18:43,740 --> 00:18:44,900
(Not AI-generated footage)

543
00:18:44,900 --> 00:18:46,980
(Welcome to the bathhouse era)

544
00:18:53,300 --> 00:18:55,620
(Bitter smile.gif)

545
00:18:57,920 --> 00:18:59,520
What is that?

546
00:19:12,060 --> 00:19:13,780
(I don't care who you are.
Just give me a name)

547
00:19:16,300 --> 00:19:19,340
(Clueless but cheerful)

548
00:19:22,660 --> 00:19:24,020
(Approaching the target)

549
00:19:24,440 --> 00:19:25,960
I'm the Armed Killer.

550
00:19:28,800 --> 00:19:30,350
I'm the Armed Killer!

551
00:19:30,740 --> 00:19:33,740
(Deaf and mute.
Is this some kind of punishment?)

552
00:19:35,860 --> 00:19:36,660
(Who)

553
00:19:36,740 --> 00:19:37,740
(On earth)

554
00:19:37,820 --> 00:19:38,580
(Is the Boss?)

555
00:19:38,820 --> 00:19:39,620
(It's me)

556
00:19:39,660 --> 00:19:40,660
(Block)

557
00:19:49,880 --> 00:19:50,920
Why haven't you attacked yet?

558
00:19:51,340 --> 00:19:53,460
(He has no idea who to shoot)

559
00:19:54,460 --> 00:19:56,460
(I'm late (Scrubbing his back))

560
00:19:57,420 --> 00:19:58,980
(Copies him instantly)

561
00:20:03,500 --> 00:20:07,340
(Boss Shen made the signal
but gave no order)

562
00:20:07,340 --> 00:20:11,540
(Boss Bai made the signal
but gave no order)

563
00:20:11,540 --> 00:20:14,140
(Boss Song made the signal
and gave the attack order)

564
00:20:15,440 --> 00:20:16,480
Bai Jingting, you're out!

565
00:20:18,020 --> 00:20:20,060
(Me?!)

566
00:20:20,140 --> 00:20:22,980
(Choosing to trust Boss Song
who gave him a clue)

567
00:20:23,020 --> 00:20:24,980
(The "boss" has no idea
what's going on)

568
00:20:26,300 --> 00:20:29,460
(Seems a little touched)

569
00:20:29,840 --> 00:20:31,880
Wrong kill.

570
00:20:32,380 --> 00:20:35,020
(Can't stop laughing)

571
00:20:35,380 --> 00:20:37,420
(What was all my reasoning for?)

572
00:20:37,820 --> 00:20:40,300
(What was I doing just now?)

573
00:20:40,840 --> 00:20:43,160
You're the Killer?

574
00:20:45,840 --> 00:20:47,040
Pro.

575
00:20:47,520 --> 00:20:48,400
Take another look at the person.

576
00:20:48,400 --> 00:20:50,360
Why are you just dancing at the camera?

577
00:20:50,820 --> 00:20:53,020
(I'm just dancing?)

578
00:20:54,260 --> 00:20:56,300
(Surrendering to fate)

579
00:20:56,340 --> 00:20:58,700
(Sorry, Chengcheng)

580
00:20:59,040 --> 00:21:01,160
I don't care who the Boss is.

581
00:21:01,160 --> 00:21:03,220
(Praying)
Can you help me find you?

582
00:21:03,220 --> 00:21:04,600
(Too embarrassed to look up.
Can't hold it in anymore)

583
00:21:04,600 --> 00:21:08,160
Can you give me a target?

584
00:21:09,040 --> 00:21:10,280
I can't find you.

585
00:21:12,380 --> 00:21:16,140
(Tearing up as he complains)
I can't find anyone to kill.

586
00:21:16,220 --> 00:21:18,780
(Too afraid to speak.
All he can do is smile bitterly)

587
00:21:18,800 --> 00:21:19,880
I can't take this anymore.

588
00:21:20,840 --> 00:21:22,160
Let me find you.

589
00:21:24,600 --> 00:21:25,080
I...

590
00:21:25,360 --> 00:21:26,600
My boss.

591
00:21:26,840 --> 00:21:29,160
Your signal is way too cryptic.

592
00:21:29,600 --> 00:21:30,720
Sometimes I can figure it out,

593
00:21:30,720 --> 00:21:32,400
and sometimes I can't.

594
00:21:32,400 --> 00:21:33,180
(I can't figure it out!
Stop being so cryptic, Boss Song)

595
00:21:33,260 --> 00:21:34,820
(Ye is just enjoying himself)

596
00:21:36,740 --> 00:21:39,300
(A refreshing moment)

597
00:21:41,980 --> 00:21:44,660
(Rolling his eyes)

598
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:45,560
That's it.

599
00:21:45,560 --> 00:21:47,880
I think Teng is his boss.

600
00:21:48,420 --> 00:21:49,980
(You figured it out?)

601
00:21:51,280 --> 00:21:52,280
I'm your teammate!

602
00:21:53,560 --> 00:21:55,180
I'm your teammate.

603
00:21:55,460 --> 00:21:56,580
(I knew it)

604
00:21:59,140 --> 00:22:01,220
(Gun loaded. Waiting for the hit list)

605
00:22:01,880 --> 00:22:03,000
Everyone, close your eyes.

606
00:22:03,000 --> 00:22:03,820
(The boss is completely dazed)

607
00:22:03,860 --> 00:22:05,820
(This round is in the bag)

608
00:22:07,600 --> 00:22:09,400
Boss, open your eyes.

609
00:22:10,380 --> 00:22:11,680
(Apparently forgot his own role)

610
00:22:11,680 --> 00:22:12,200
Boss, open your eyes

611
00:22:12,200 --> 00:22:14,440
and choose a target.

612
00:22:14,440 --> 00:22:16,260
(Blank)

613
00:22:19,120 --> 00:22:21,160
Boss, please open your eyes.

614
00:22:22,380 --> 00:22:25,480
(Memory of a goldfish)
Look at your target.

615
00:22:25,620 --> 00:22:28,340
(Target: Jia Bing)

616
00:22:28,560 --> 00:22:29,120
Open your eyes.

617
00:22:32,140 --> 00:22:33,740
(We've got this!)

618
00:22:33,780 --> 00:22:34,660
(Waiting patiently to make eye contact)

619
00:22:34,660 --> 00:22:35,580
(Secret Signal: Showering freely)

620
00:22:35,580 --> 00:22:36,620
(Boss: Shen Teng, Killer:
Fan Chengcheng, Target: Jia Bing)

621
00:22:36,660 --> 00:22:39,580
(A little dance for everyone
before attacking)

622
00:22:39,620 --> 00:22:41,180
(Celebrate my victory in advance)

623
00:22:43,500 --> 00:22:45,420
(Give me a glance)

624
00:22:54,620 --> 00:22:56,660
(Waiting for a chance
to approach Killer Cheng)

625
00:22:59,220 --> 00:23:01,140
(Turning around to follow Boss Song)

626
00:23:01,220 --> 00:23:03,580
(Coming, Boss Song)

627
00:23:04,060 --> 00:23:05,460
(Coming, Chengcheng)

628
00:23:05,500 --> 00:23:08,140
(Trying not to laugh.
Go ahead, Boss Song)

629
00:23:09,020 --> 00:23:10,820
(Chengcheng, wait for me)

630
00:23:10,860 --> 00:23:13,660
(He's after him, and he's after him)

631
00:23:14,860 --> 00:23:17,300
(Evil little guy
is about to make his move)

632
00:23:18,320 --> 00:23:19,260
Bai Jingting.

633
00:23:19,300 --> 00:23:20,620
(Got it)

634
00:23:21,500 --> 00:23:23,460
(Waiting desperately for eye contact)

635
00:23:25,220 --> 00:23:26,620
(Getting ready to attack)
Bai Jingting.

636
00:23:26,820 --> 00:23:29,420
(Completely oblivious
and still scrubbing himself)

637
00:23:30,260 --> 00:23:32,740
(Waiting in line for eye contact)

638
00:23:34,580 --> 00:23:36,740
(Waiting for the perfect moment)

639
00:23:38,500 --> 00:23:40,660
(Chengcheng, wait for me)

640
00:23:40,920 --> 00:23:41,920
Bai Jingting, you're out!

641
00:23:42,480 --> 00:23:43,480
Bai Jingting, you're out.

642
00:23:46,120 --> 00:23:47,120
Bai Jingting, you're out!

643
00:23:47,120 --> 00:23:48,940
(Why did he shoot?!,
Why is it me again?!)

644
00:23:50,740 --> 00:23:53,060
(Boss Song, did I do the right thing?)

645
00:23:53,380 --> 00:23:54,540
(Ye has no idea what's going on)

646
00:23:59,120 --> 00:24:00,440
Wrong kill.

647
00:24:03,260 --> 00:24:05,060
(100% genius)

648
00:24:06,020 --> 00:24:07,220
(Phew)

649
00:24:07,960 --> 00:24:08,440
If Bai hadn't

650
00:24:08,440 --> 00:24:09,040
been killed,

651
00:24:09,040 --> 00:24:10,120
I'd think it was him.

652
00:24:10,120 --> 00:24:11,180
(Just trying to save face)

653
00:24:13,200 --> 00:24:13,680
I still

654
00:24:13,680 --> 00:24:15,080
have no idea who my boss is.

655
00:24:15,820 --> 00:24:17,260
(Boss Song cracks up)

656
00:24:17,680 --> 00:24:19,400
Feels like
I've got five different Bosses.

657
00:24:19,400 --> 00:24:21,360
I can't figure out who the real Boss is.

658
00:24:22,320 --> 00:24:23,400
It's not you, is it?

659
00:24:24,420 --> 00:24:25,740
(Laughs in frustration)

660
00:24:28,160 --> 00:24:29,440
The Werewolf's already used two bullets,

661
00:24:29,680 --> 00:24:31,680
so there's no way to finish the mission.

662
00:24:31,680 --> 00:24:33,120
But honestly,

663
00:24:34,040 --> 00:24:35,360
this round was really tough.

664
00:24:35,360 --> 00:24:37,280
(Trying to defend himself)
The whole scenario

665
00:24:37,280 --> 00:24:38,680
was set in a bathhouse.

666
00:24:39,920 --> 00:24:41,000
It felt like everyone was...

667
00:24:41,000 --> 00:24:41,920
Taking a bath.

668
00:24:41,920 --> 00:24:42,760
Scrubbing themselves, bathing.

669
00:24:43,280 --> 00:24:44,360
Who started showering first?

670
00:24:44,460 --> 00:24:45,460
(And here's the big question)

671
00:24:45,920 --> 00:24:46,200
Teng.

672
00:24:46,200 --> 00:24:46,880
(Points at him)
Teng started showering.

673
00:24:46,880 --> 00:24:47,640
Teng started scrubbing.

674
00:24:47,640 --> 00:24:48,040
Who went first?

675
00:24:48,040 --> 00:24:48,520
Teng started scrubbing first.

676
00:24:48,520 --> 00:24:49,520
He was the first one to shower.

677
00:24:51,260 --> 00:24:52,240
I was like, "What is this?"

678
00:24:52,240 --> 00:24:53,280
And suddenly it clicked. The showerhead.

679
00:24:53,280 --> 00:24:53,960
The showerhead.

680
00:24:54,880 --> 00:24:56,080
Everyone else figured it out.

681
00:24:56,800 --> 00:24:57,960
How did he miss it?

682
00:25:06,060 --> 00:25:08,340
(Laughing so hard he's on the floor)

683
00:25:09,000 --> 00:25:09,640
Was it him?

684
00:25:12,640 --> 00:25:13,360
No.

685
00:25:13,360 --> 00:25:14,440
We were all lined up just now.

686
00:25:14,440 --> 00:25:15,120
You were over there

687
00:25:15,880 --> 00:25:16,640
scrubbing him.

688
00:25:16,880 --> 00:25:17,760
No!

689
00:25:17,760 --> 00:25:20,080
(Do you have any idea how hard I tried?)
Jingyu was ahead of Bai.

690
00:25:20,080 --> 00:25:21,320
(Waiting patiently in line)
I was just waiting

691
00:25:21,320 --> 00:25:22,000
for Bai to leave.

692
00:25:22,020 --> 00:25:23,980
(Such a considerate Boss)

693
00:25:27,760 --> 00:25:29,280
But when it was finally my turn,

694
00:25:29,280 --> 00:25:30,040
job was done.

695
00:25:33,160 --> 00:25:33,880
At first,

696
00:25:33,880 --> 00:25:35,320
I thought Bai was

697
00:25:35,320 --> 00:25:35,880
the one

698
00:25:35,880 --> 00:25:36,880
after me.

699
00:25:38,540 --> 00:25:40,460
(Didn't even get to sit for a second)

700
00:25:43,960 --> 00:25:45,400
(Wanna hear my side of the story?)
I was just walking by.

701
00:25:45,400 --> 00:25:46,320
I'd just finished showering here.

702
00:25:47,600 --> 00:25:48,040
Teng said something.

703
00:25:48,040 --> 00:25:49,360
I couldn't hear him clearly,

704
00:25:49,360 --> 00:25:51,040
but I'm pretty sure
he said someone's name.

705
00:25:52,260 --> 00:25:53,660
(Silently mouthing "Jia Bing")

706
00:25:56,960 --> 00:25:57,600
I figured

707
00:25:57,600 --> 00:25:58,760
I'd look cool

708
00:25:58,760 --> 00:25:59,720
walking past.

709
00:25:59,720 --> 00:26:00,480
So I said, "Jia Bing."

710
00:26:02,020 --> 00:26:04,020
(So you were trying to kill me)

711
00:26:04,440 --> 00:26:05,840
You definitely looked cool.

712
00:26:05,840 --> 00:26:07,120
You just picked the wrong guy.

713
00:26:09,320 --> 00:26:11,200
I thought you already
knew it was Chengcheng.

714
00:26:11,800 --> 00:26:13,600
I figured out
it was him in the second round.

715
00:26:13,920 --> 00:26:15,080
He gave himself away!

716
00:26:15,080 --> 00:26:16,280
Of course you figured it out,

717
00:26:23,080 --> 00:26:25,480
(Drawing roles)
Alright, let's start round two.

718
00:26:40,360 --> 00:26:41,340
(Claiming to be the Seer)
Bing's got a special role.

719
00:26:43,080 --> 00:26:43,720
Put your stickers on.

720
00:26:45,040 --> 00:26:46,560
Why'd you stick them all over your foot?

721
00:26:46,580 --> 00:26:48,100
(He's got a plan of his own)

722
00:26:48,320 --> 00:26:49,600
Everyone, close your eyes.

723
00:26:50,520 --> 00:26:52,800
Armed Killer, open your eyes.

724
00:26:56,580 --> 00:26:57,580
(This round's Killer: Jia Bing)

725
00:26:57,600 --> 00:26:59,320
Here's your Secret Signal.

726
00:26:59,320 --> 00:27:00,740
(Secret Signal: Zangzu dance)

727
00:27:01,600 --> 00:27:03,280
Boss, open your eyes.

728
00:27:04,560 --> 00:27:05,320
Bing and Fan Chengcheng.

729
00:27:07,900 --> 00:27:09,780
(This round's Boss: Huang Jingyu)

730
00:27:09,800 --> 00:27:12,260
(Secret Signal: Zangzu dance)
Here's your Secret Signal.

731
00:27:12,280 --> 00:27:14,740
(Target: Hu Xianxu)
Here's your target for this round.

732
00:27:15,520 --> 00:27:17,200
Okay, close your eyes.

733
00:27:17,200 --> 00:27:18,040
Everyone, open your eyes.

734
00:27:19,040 --> 00:27:20,200
I'm the Killer with the bullets.

735
00:27:20,200 --> 00:27:21,220
(First to claim he's the Killer)

736
00:27:21,260 --> 00:27:22,620
(Putting on an act now?)

737
00:27:24,760 --> 00:27:25,400
Me too.

738
00:27:25,820 --> 00:27:27,460
(Claiming to be the Killer too)

739
00:27:28,520 --> 00:27:29,520
Huang Jingyu, you're out.

740
00:27:29,520 --> 00:27:31,780
(Just having some fun)

741
00:27:33,700 --> 00:27:35,100
(Ready for action)

742
00:27:35,140 --> 00:27:37,300
(Dance Party: Clueless Killer, Round 2)

743
00:27:37,300 --> 00:27:37,740
(Secret Signal: Zangzu dance)

744
00:27:37,740 --> 00:27:39,700
(Zangzu dancing begins)

745
00:27:40,100 --> 00:27:41,540
(What's that noise?)

746
00:27:41,540 --> 00:27:42,740
(Boss: Huang Jingyu,
Killer: Jia Bing, Target: Hu Xianxu)

747
00:27:42,740 --> 00:27:44,580
(Dancing away)

748
00:27:45,020 --> 00:27:47,980
(Staring)

749
00:27:48,260 --> 00:27:49,860
(Just an innocent player
who happens to be a great dancer)

750
00:27:49,900 --> 00:27:52,100
(Is it her?)

751
00:27:52,140 --> 00:27:54,340
(Is it her?)

752
00:27:56,160 --> 00:27:56,920
Hu Xianxu, you're out.

753
00:27:56,940 --> 00:27:58,180
(Fires a shot to hint at the target)

754
00:28:00,180 --> 00:28:02,000
(Will Churan make a move?)

755
00:28:02,000 --> 00:28:02,760
Bai, you're out.

756
00:28:03,820 --> 00:28:05,940
(Rules out Churan)

757
00:28:08,700 --> 00:28:10,900
(Now he's getting into it)

758
00:28:11,120 --> 00:28:11,800
Get out!

759
00:28:11,800 --> 00:28:13,420
(Command failed. Just a fake shot)

760
00:28:15,100 --> 00:28:16,220
(Back to figuring it out)

761
00:28:17,140 --> 00:28:19,220
(Another innocent player
with killer dance moves joins in)

762
00:28:19,380 --> 00:28:20,540
(Is it him?)

763
00:28:21,460 --> 00:28:23,220
(Showing off Secret Signal)

764
00:28:23,260 --> 00:28:25,380
(Dancing gracefully)

765
00:28:26,500 --> 00:28:28,060
(Boss Huang spotted)

766
00:28:28,380 --> 00:28:30,780
(Dance floor showdown with the Boss)

767
00:28:31,340 --> 00:28:34,660
(Good dancers
are multiplying like crazy)

768
00:28:36,240 --> 00:28:37,380
(Pretending to be the Killer)
Huang Jingyu, you're out.

769
00:28:38,820 --> 00:28:40,780
(Rules out Chengcheng)

770
00:28:42,540 --> 00:28:44,020
(So gentle)

771
00:28:45,940 --> 00:28:48,740
(All he knows
is waving his hands around)

772
00:28:49,260 --> 00:28:51,260
(What's going on??)

773
00:28:52,000 --> 00:28:53,400
Still haven't figured out who it is?

774
00:28:54,660 --> 00:28:57,500
(Exhausted from laughing, not dancing)

775
00:28:58,540 --> 00:29:00,780
(Wait, could it actually be you?)

776
00:29:04,420 --> 00:29:06,580
(Sneaking around)

777
00:29:06,600 --> 00:29:07,480
I've still got a bunch of stickers left.

778
00:29:09,980 --> 00:29:11,660
(Dancing)

779
00:29:13,700 --> 00:29:17,460
(Tagging along)

780
00:29:20,740 --> 00:29:23,020
(The only one
still doing the Zangzu dance)

781
00:29:25,180 --> 00:29:27,780
(They finally recognize each other)

782
00:29:27,820 --> 00:29:30,220
(Tagging along)

783
00:29:30,220 --> 00:29:32,980
(Dance floor's heating up)

784
00:29:33,020 --> 00:29:34,300
(Enjoying the show)

785
00:29:34,460 --> 00:29:36,540
(Another spectator joins in)

786
00:29:36,580 --> 00:29:39,060
(Secretly making contact in the chaos)

787
00:29:39,660 --> 00:29:41,280
(Kill Hu. Target confirmed)

788
00:29:41,280 --> 00:29:42,080
Kill Hu.

789
00:29:42,080 --> 00:29:43,220
(Lost in the music)

790
00:29:43,660 --> 00:29:45,260
(I can't with this anymore)

791
00:29:45,300 --> 00:29:47,780
(Kill Hu)

792
00:29:48,040 --> 00:29:49,320
Hu, you're out.

793
00:29:53,240 --> 00:29:53,840
That's a hit.

794
00:29:53,840 --> 00:29:55,820
(Hu Xianxu is out)

795
00:29:56,000 --> 00:29:56,480
What?

796
00:29:56,480 --> 00:29:58,100
(Wait, seriously?)

797
00:30:01,820 --> 00:30:04,100
(Completely stunned)

798
00:30:07,560 --> 00:30:09,200
I told you Bing had a special role.

799
00:30:09,480 --> 00:30:10,080
I fired my shot right out in the open.

800
00:30:11,200 --> 00:30:12,160
Anyone got a problem with that?
Come at me.

801
00:30:12,960 --> 00:30:14,120
Something seems suspicious.

802
00:30:14,120 --> 00:30:15,920
(Has a little insight)
I think those three people dancing

803
00:30:15,920 --> 00:30:16,520
up there are really suspicious.

804
00:30:17,700 --> 00:30:19,820
(Suspect list: Not a single Killer)

805
00:30:20,160 --> 00:30:21,900
(Even the Boss can't take it anymore)
Wang Churan suddenly gets an idea.

806
00:30:23,320 --> 00:30:25,440
Song is definitely
in a world of his own.

807
00:30:25,460 --> 00:30:27,240
(Quite a character)

808
00:30:27,240 --> 00:30:28,120
I feel like

809
00:30:28,120 --> 00:30:29,920
Song's acting a little...

810
00:30:30,380 --> 00:30:31,280
(Me? Seriously?)
What'd I do this time?

811
00:30:31,280 --> 00:30:31,800
No.

812
00:30:31,800 --> 00:30:33,520
(Bai's watching his every move)
You even pulled off

813
00:30:33,520 --> 00:30:33,880
that move

814
00:30:34,440 --> 00:30:34,800
just now.

815
00:30:34,800 --> 00:30:36,320
(Being weird makes him a suspect)

816
00:30:36,320 --> 00:30:36,880
Not necessarily.

817
00:30:37,480 --> 00:30:38,880
Actually, when those two went up there,

818
00:30:38,880 --> 00:30:40,400
everyone was looking this way.

819
00:30:40,400 --> 00:30:41,880
(Figured out when the Boss and Killer connected)
But the signal came from over here.

820
00:30:41,880 --> 00:30:43,200
And Bing made his move afterward.

821
00:30:43,880 --> 00:30:44,480
That makes sense.

822
00:30:46,600 --> 00:30:47,560
Was it you?

823
00:30:47,560 --> 00:30:48,800
(Sudden interrogation)

824
00:30:48,800 --> 00:30:49,760
Yep, it was me.

825
00:30:49,760 --> 00:30:50,900
(Doesn't even flinch)

826
00:30:51,160 --> 00:30:52,080
You're really gonna play it like that?

827
00:30:52,080 --> 00:30:53,740
(Hard to tell who's telling the truth)
What'd I do?

828
00:30:54,140 --> 00:30:56,560
(Something's definitely up)

829
00:30:56,560 --> 00:30:57,360
Everyone,

830
00:30:57,360 --> 00:30:58,120
close your eyes.

831
00:31:01,560 --> 00:31:03,400
Boss, open your eyes.

832
00:31:05,000 --> 00:31:08,400
(Target: Wang Churan)
Here's your next target.

833
00:31:08,960 --> 00:31:10,400
Everyone, open your eyes.

834
00:31:10,400 --> 00:31:12,280
Make sure your stickers are on properly.

835
00:31:12,280 --> 00:31:13,160
So I don't need to wear any?

836
00:31:13,300 --> 00:31:14,000
(Feeling untouchable)

837
00:31:14,000 --> 00:31:15,040
You can skip them.

838
00:31:15,040 --> 00:31:16,240
You're pretty cocky now,

839
00:31:16,620 --> 00:31:18,540
(Everyone's jealous)

840
00:31:18,580 --> 00:31:20,240
(Quietly putting on his stickers)

841
00:31:20,240 --> 00:31:20,680
Two?

842
00:31:22,560 --> 00:31:23,440
Wait, isn't it three?

843
00:31:23,960 --> 00:31:25,040
There's another one right here.

844
00:31:25,040 --> 00:31:26,240
Teng's showing off his English again.

845
00:31:28,980 --> 00:31:32,540
(The mission continues)

846
00:31:35,060 --> 00:31:36,180
(Watching the hand signals)

847
00:31:36,180 --> 00:31:37,940
(Boss: Huang Jingyu,
Killer: Jia Bing, Target: Wang Churan)

848
00:31:38,040 --> 00:31:38,920
Who's number seven?

849
00:31:38,920 --> 00:31:39,840
(On high alert)

850
00:31:39,840 --> 00:31:40,840
Who's number seven?

851
00:31:41,500 --> 00:31:43,100
(Waiting for the target info)

852
00:31:45,060 --> 00:31:46,220
(Waiting for the right moment)

853
00:31:46,260 --> 00:31:47,940
(Casually signaling the target)

854
00:31:48,140 --> 00:31:49,300
(Dodges sideways)

855
00:31:49,640 --> 00:31:50,160
Why're you dodging?

856
00:31:50,160 --> 00:31:51,360
Where're you going?

857
00:31:51,360 --> 00:31:52,960
(Signal interrupted)
He pointed at me. I got scared.

858
00:31:52,980 --> 00:31:55,380
(Churan's suspect list)

859
00:31:57,180 --> 00:31:58,940
(Showing off some fancy footwork)

860
00:31:58,980 --> 00:32:00,860
(Doing his best
to shake off the stickers)

861
00:32:01,100 --> 00:32:02,120
(The Killer moves closer)

862
00:32:02,120 --> 00:32:02,720
Stand still.

863
00:32:03,060 --> 00:32:04,380
(Got a special role
and now you're in charge?)

864
00:32:06,660 --> 00:32:10,300
(Reconnecting)

865
00:32:11,940 --> 00:32:14,060
(Playing the Killer)

866
00:32:15,820 --> 00:32:18,260
(Signal received. Secretly thrilled)

867
00:32:23,460 --> 00:32:25,460
(Just trying to look cool)

868
00:32:28,180 --> 00:32:29,780
(Just passing through)

869
00:32:29,820 --> 00:32:30,700
(Waiting for his chance)

870
00:32:31,180 --> 00:32:31,980
(Ready to shoot at any moment)

871
00:32:33,140 --> 00:32:34,780
(Making the target obvious)

872
00:32:34,860 --> 00:32:36,540
(Target confirmed)

873
00:32:36,600 --> 00:32:38,040
Wang Churan, you're out.

874
00:32:38,200 --> 00:32:38,600
Me?

875
00:32:40,600 --> 00:32:42,080
Congratulations, Killer.

876
00:32:42,080 --> 00:32:43,000
That's a hit.

877
00:32:43,000 --> 00:32:43,940
(Wang Churan is out)

878
00:32:44,020 --> 00:32:47,540
(These two are way too cool)

879
00:32:47,580 --> 00:32:49,500
(How are they so good?)

880
00:32:49,920 --> 00:32:50,840
Who was it?

881
00:32:54,480 --> 00:32:56,640
What did I miss just now?

882
00:32:56,640 --> 00:32:58,000
I was watching Bai the whole time.

883
00:32:58,260 --> 00:32:59,540
(Well, you were watching the wrong guy)

884
00:33:01,440 --> 00:33:02,720
Bing's actually really smart.

885
00:33:02,720 --> 00:33:04,840
He keeps an eye
on where everyone's looking.

886
00:33:04,840 --> 00:33:05,760
He just laid back

887
00:33:05,760 --> 00:33:06,640
and made his kills.

888
00:33:07,520 --> 00:33:10,800
I don't even care how he makes his kill.

889
00:33:10,800 --> 00:33:11,780
(It's called "layback")
Layback.

890
00:33:12,040 --> 00:33:12,560
Whatever.

891
00:33:12,560 --> 00:33:13,040
A little offbeat.

892
00:33:14,000 --> 00:33:14,560
Whatever.

893
00:33:14,560 --> 00:33:15,280
(Still making excuses)

894
00:33:15,280 --> 00:33:18,360
The thing is,
Bai didn't lose a single sticker.

895
00:33:19,300 --> 00:33:20,380
(Zero stickers left)

896
00:33:20,460 --> 00:33:21,660
(How did none of them fall off?)

897
00:33:21,740 --> 00:33:23,380
(Major discovery!)

898
00:33:23,640 --> 00:33:25,440
(Can't resist piling on)
They'll fall off your sleeves.

899
00:33:25,440 --> 00:33:26,760
A million percent.

900
00:33:26,760 --> 00:33:27,420
(After years of sticker research,
a groundbreaking discovery)

901
00:33:27,420 --> 00:33:29,450
I don't care
what kind of kill you're talking about.

902
00:33:31,280 --> 00:33:32,700
I seriously couldn't
get these things off.

903
00:33:32,700 --> 00:33:33,600
(Blame the super-sticky glue)

904
00:33:33,600 --> 00:33:34,240
Teng.

905
00:33:34,260 --> 00:33:35,960
(Starting to get suspicious)

906
00:33:35,960 --> 00:33:37,800
Everyone, close your eyes.

907
00:33:38,380 --> 00:33:39,840
Boss, open your eyes.

908
00:33:41,240 --> 00:33:43,700
(Target: Fan Chengcheng)
Here's your target for this round.

909
00:33:43,940 --> 00:33:46,540
(Watching secretly)

910
00:33:47,660 --> 00:33:53,150
("Churan's Hunt for the Killer")

911
00:33:53,160 --> 00:33:53,800
Open your eyes.

912
00:33:54,260 --> 00:33:55,640
(Who is it?)

913
00:33:55,640 --> 00:33:56,760
Come on, put your stickers on.

914
00:34:01,040 --> 00:34:01,980
Wait, could it be you?

915
00:34:01,980 --> 00:34:02,600
(Chuckles)

916
00:34:02,600 --> 00:34:03,760
I didn't see anyone
open their eyes just now.

917
00:34:04,280 --> 00:34:05,760
I've already been eliminated!

918
00:34:05,760 --> 00:34:07,680
(All the clues are coming together)
You're still suspecting Hu?

919
00:34:07,680 --> 00:34:08,800
Wang Churan!

920
00:34:09,080 --> 00:34:09,920
I think it is Hu.

921
00:34:10,190 --> 00:34:11,190
I have not even acted yet.

922
00:34:11,190 --> 00:34:12,040
Have not performed yet.

923
00:34:12,560 --> 00:34:12,920
She...

924
00:34:13,020 --> 00:34:14,700
(Speechless)

925
00:34:15,280 --> 00:34:17,320
She picked me again.

926
00:34:17,320 --> 00:34:18,920
(Even the bystanders are fed up)
You again.

927
00:34:18,920 --> 00:34:20,820
(Missed the killer opening his eyes)
I did not see anyone open their eyes.

928
00:34:20,900 --> 00:34:21,200
(Caught in the crossfire)

929
00:34:21,200 --> 00:34:22,540
Adding insult to injury.

930
00:34:22,540 --> 00:34:23,800
He has been gone for a while.

931
00:34:23,800 --> 00:34:24,940
He has gone off to enjoy himself.

932
00:34:24,980 --> 00:34:26,740
(There is nothing I can do)

933
00:34:27,000 --> 00:34:28,190
(Confident)
Let's keep our eyes on Bai

934
00:34:28,190 --> 00:34:29,920
and see how he signals the others.

935
00:34:29,940 --> 00:34:30,560
(Completely overwhelmed)

936
00:34:30,560 --> 00:34:31,190
Come on.

937
00:34:31,190 --> 00:34:32,150
Today,

938
00:34:32,150 --> 00:34:33,560
I am going all out too.

939
00:34:33,560 --> 00:34:34,500
(Giving it everything!)

940
00:34:34,700 --> 00:34:36,220
(Almost lost his balance)

941
00:34:38,380 --> 00:34:40,220
(The mission continues)

942
00:34:40,220 --> 00:34:41,780
(Boss: Huang Jingyu, Killer: Jia Bing,
Target: Fan Chengcheng)

943
00:34:42,140 --> 00:34:45,500
(The killer is ready to strike)

944
00:34:45,580 --> 00:34:48,180
(Watching closely)

945
00:34:48,380 --> 00:34:50,580
(Let me see)

946
00:34:50,740 --> 00:34:52,660
(Tossing the sticker)

947
00:34:52,760 --> 00:34:54,150
Swing that hand.

948
00:34:54,150 --> 00:34:55,580
(No longer free to swing that hand)

949
00:34:56,080 --> 00:34:57,360
Swing this hand.

950
00:34:57,360 --> 00:34:58,940
I told you to swing this hand.

951
00:34:58,940 --> 00:35:00,820
(Quietly following orders)

952
00:35:03,220 --> 00:35:04,180
(Swinging)

953
00:35:04,220 --> 00:35:06,460
(Intentionally defying him)

954
00:35:07,580 --> 00:35:08,980
(What just went by?)

955
00:35:09,060 --> 00:35:11,060
(Watching closely)

956
00:35:11,100 --> 00:35:12,540
(How did things come to this?)

957
00:35:13,180 --> 00:35:14,940
(Exchanging signals in plain sight)

958
00:35:15,000 --> 00:35:15,800
(Playing along
while secretly signaling the target)

959
00:35:15,800 --> 00:35:16,160
I am done.

960
00:35:16,160 --> 00:35:17,840
Stand up straight.

961
00:35:17,840 --> 00:35:19,160
Stop using Brazilian jiu-jitsu so often.

962
00:35:19,160 --> 00:35:19,920
Understood?

963
00:35:20,740 --> 00:35:22,580
(Signal received)

964
00:35:27,200 --> 00:35:27,800
Come on, smile.

965
00:35:29,420 --> 00:35:31,060
(Playing along obediently)

966
00:35:36,060 --> 00:35:38,580
(No need to rush. Let the innocent
suspects turn on each other)

967
00:35:38,660 --> 00:35:39,900
(Pointing)

968
00:35:41,680 --> 00:35:42,400
He is pointing at me.

969
00:35:42,860 --> 00:35:44,420
(Go ahead. Keep pointing)

970
00:35:46,060 --> 00:35:48,020
(Keeping a close eye on Bai Jingting)

971
00:35:48,520 --> 00:35:49,360
Does that bother you?

972
00:35:50,340 --> 00:35:50,860
No.

973
00:35:50,860 --> 00:35:52,140
(Still refusing to admit it)

974
00:35:52,180 --> 00:35:53,620
(Fuming on the inside)

975
00:35:53,960 --> 00:35:55,000
If something is bothering you, tell me.

976
00:35:55,000 --> 00:35:55,480
What is wrong?

977
00:35:56,920 --> 00:35:57,400
Let him dance.

978
00:35:57,400 --> 00:35:58,540
(Avenge me!)

979
00:35:58,880 --> 00:35:59,560
Dance!

980
00:36:01,260 --> 00:36:03,780
(An impressively
cooperative performance)

981
00:36:08,940 --> 00:36:10,940
(Waiting for an opportunity
to frame someone)

982
00:36:11,240 --> 00:36:12,440
Am I going to be eliminated?

983
00:36:12,500 --> 00:36:13,980
(Come on, make it more convincing)

984
00:36:14,020 --> 00:36:15,700
(The killer makes his move)

985
00:36:21,920 --> 00:36:22,840
Fan Chengcheng, you are out!

986
00:36:25,360 --> 00:36:26,800
(The boss and killer have completed
their mission. Fan Chengcheng is out)

987
00:36:26,800 --> 00:36:27,870
All three shots hit their targets.

988
00:36:27,900 --> 00:36:31,580
(Impressive performance)

989
00:36:32,340 --> 00:36:33,740
(Well done)

990
00:36:33,920 --> 00:36:35,000
(Only concerned about this)
So, is it Bai?

991
00:36:40,480 --> 00:36:41,560
It is definitely Teng.

992
00:36:41,900 --> 00:36:43,180
(The boss is delighted)

993
00:36:43,240 --> 00:36:44,400
Definitely.

994
00:36:45,360 --> 00:36:46,160
Teng.

995
00:36:46,340 --> 00:36:47,720
(Even standing in the corner
makes him suspicious?)

996
00:36:47,720 --> 00:36:49,000
You look so innocent.

997
00:36:50,120 --> 00:36:51,040
Your performance today

998
00:36:51,040 --> 00:36:52,440
matches the color of your clothes.

999
00:36:52,440 --> 00:36:53,200
What?

1000
00:36:54,200 --> 00:36:54,760
A complete mess.

1001
00:36:54,760 --> 00:36:56,500
(Immediately understood)

1002
00:36:58,060 --> 00:37:00,580
(Precisely targeted)

1003
00:37:02,880 --> 00:37:03,600
It was not me.

1004
00:37:04,700 --> 00:37:05,960
(Poking)
Bai, it was not me.

1005
00:37:06,580 --> 00:37:07,500
(Continues poking him)

1006
00:37:07,500 --> 00:37:08,500
(My poor stomach)

1007
00:37:08,640 --> 00:37:10,280
Black and yellow pair.

1008
00:37:13,160 --> 00:37:14,440
Why are you pointing at me?

1009
00:37:15,100 --> 00:37:17,280
(Sorry, Song. I cannot help you)

1010
00:37:17,280 --> 00:37:19,360
Song was the first to stand on a chair.

1011
00:37:19,360 --> 00:37:21,840
That certainly made quite a commotion.

1012
00:37:21,840 --> 00:37:22,760
No, that's...

1013
00:37:22,760 --> 00:37:24,040
He is not usually like this

1014
00:37:24,040 --> 00:37:24,840
in everyday life.

1015
00:37:24,840 --> 00:37:26,240
Then what is he like in private?

1016
00:37:26,240 --> 00:37:26,880
Do you know?

1017
00:37:27,960 --> 00:37:29,720
I just did it on impulse.

1018
00:37:29,720 --> 00:37:32,360
That is exactly
what the innocent ones fear.

1019
00:37:32,360 --> 00:37:32,800
Really.

1020
00:37:32,800 --> 00:37:34,080
What suddenly made you

1021
00:37:34,080 --> 00:37:34,720
decide to dance?

1022
00:37:34,720 --> 00:37:36,400
I just felt like doing it.

1023
00:37:36,700 --> 00:37:38,580
(One who benefited
from a sudden impulse)

1024
00:37:38,920 --> 00:37:39,680
Anyway, it was not me.

1025
00:37:39,820 --> 00:37:41,320
(The innocent have nothing to hide)

1026
00:37:41,320 --> 00:37:42,000
He simply fell over.

1027
00:37:43,240 --> 00:37:44,400
I will go after anyone who targets me.

1028
00:37:49,240 --> 00:37:51,240
I think Bai...

1029
00:37:51,240 --> 00:37:51,920
There he goes again.

1030
00:37:52,320 --> 00:37:54,040
(Two years ago: Fate was set in motion)
I will vote for Bai first.

1031
00:37:54,040 --> 00:37:55,200
He goes after anyone who targets him.

1032
00:37:56,940 --> 00:37:58,100
(Every accusation counts)

1033
00:37:59,300 --> 00:38:00,580
(This boy is completely innocent)

1034
00:38:00,600 --> 00:38:01,040
Bai,

1035
00:38:01,600 --> 00:38:03,160
he is using that trick on you
in Huairou.

1036
00:38:03,260 --> 00:38:04,520
(That is another matter)

1037
00:38:04,520 --> 00:38:06,600
He is playing
the innocent card with you.

1038
00:38:08,200 --> 00:38:09,640
Nothing wrong with that.

1039
00:38:09,640 --> 00:38:10,760
(Stirring up trouble)
Do you have no relatives

1040
00:38:10,760 --> 00:38:11,120
here?

1041
00:38:12,100 --> 00:38:13,940
(Still smiling innocently)

1042
00:38:14,000 --> 00:38:14,960
I think it is Song.

1043
00:38:15,720 --> 00:38:17,480
My suspect is...

1044
00:38:17,480 --> 00:38:19,160
(My suspect)
The person I suspect...

1045
00:38:20,560 --> 00:38:22,320
I suspect

1046
00:38:22,320 --> 00:38:22,920
Bai.

1047
00:38:23,180 --> 00:38:24,140
(It is definitely Bai,
mouthing silently)

1048
00:38:24,140 --> 00:38:26,260
(I will not back down.
Bai, mouthing silently)

1049
00:38:26,440 --> 00:38:27,560
At first, I suspected Bai.

1050
00:38:28,040 --> 00:38:30,120
But I watched him closely that round.

1051
00:38:30,120 --> 00:38:31,520
Bai never pointed at him.

1052
00:38:31,520 --> 00:38:32,800
(Teng's observation:
Bai never pointed at Chengcheng)

1053
00:38:32,800 --> 00:38:33,800
Not with his eyes or his toes,

1054
00:38:33,800 --> 00:38:34,280
or even his...

1055
00:38:35,400 --> 00:38:35,920
hips.

1056
00:38:35,920 --> 00:38:36,440
(Hips)

1057
00:38:36,440 --> 00:38:36,800
Hips?

1058
00:38:37,440 --> 00:38:38,760
Or his hands.

1059
00:38:38,760 --> 00:38:39,760
He never pointed at him.

1060
00:38:40,240 --> 00:38:41,560
(Sharp observation)
So Bai definitely cannot be the killer.

1061
00:38:41,660 --> 00:38:42,820
(Exactly)

1062
00:38:43,120 --> 00:38:43,920
Therefore,

1063
00:38:44,320 --> 00:38:45,480
it should be Jingyu.

1064
00:38:45,480 --> 00:38:46,320
(How did I become the suspect?)

1065
00:38:46,320 --> 00:38:48,660
(Let me think of a defense)
If that is the case,

1066
00:38:48,960 --> 00:38:51,240
before Chengcheng was eliminated,

1067
00:38:51,240 --> 00:38:52,800
Bai and he were having a dance-off.

1068
00:38:52,800 --> 00:38:54,840
Then Chengcheng asked
whether he was going to die.

1069
00:38:54,840 --> 00:38:56,760
And immediately afterward, he was shot.

1070
00:38:56,980 --> 00:38:58,880
(He is targeting me again)

1071
00:38:58,880 --> 00:38:59,400
Time to vote.

1072
00:39:01,160 --> 00:39:02,640
One, two, three, four.

1073
00:39:02,640 --> 00:39:04,460
(Poking)
One, two, three, four. Not pointing.

1074
00:39:04,460 --> 00:39:06,780
(My finger has settled here)
One, two, three, four.

1075
00:39:06,920 --> 00:39:07,680
Please cast your votes.

1076
00:39:07,740 --> 00:39:09,580
(Bai Jingting: OUT, Bai Jingting: 2 votes,
Huang Jingyu: 1 vote, Song Yaxuan: 1 vote)

1077
00:39:09,920 --> 00:39:11,120
Teng, what are you doing?

1078
00:39:11,880 --> 00:39:13,920
Look at the paper slip. It says one.

1079
00:39:13,920 --> 00:39:15,400
Look at the finger. It is Huang Jingyu.

1080
00:39:15,400 --> 00:39:17,620
(As expected of you)

1081
00:39:17,640 --> 00:39:19,680
Bai's identity is

1082
00:39:19,680 --> 00:39:20,040
a Good Guy.

1083
00:39:25,720 --> 00:39:27,120
But it was not me. It was not me.

1084
00:39:27,120 --> 00:39:27,960
(Completely innocent)

1085
00:39:27,960 --> 00:39:28,520
It really was not me.

1086
00:39:29,200 --> 00:39:30,700
(It was him)
Then Teng is the only one left.

1087
00:39:31,760 --> 00:39:32,940
(A little unsure now)
Are you serious?

1088
00:39:36,880 --> 00:39:38,360
Let's leave this battle

1089
00:39:38,360 --> 00:39:39,120
of honor up to him.

1090
00:39:39,140 --> 00:39:40,860
(Let's see what happens)

1091
00:39:47,320 --> 00:39:48,160
Jingyu

1092
00:39:48,160 --> 00:39:48,560
is the boss.

1093
00:39:48,560 --> 00:39:51,460
