2173
01:15:36,600 --> 01:15:38,040
There's only one kind of plant.

2174
01:15:38,040 --> 01:15:39,000
A plant.

2175
01:15:39,900 --> 01:15:42,060
(Trying to be clever, but failing)

2176
01:15:42,080 --> 01:15:44,200
I seriously wanna kick him.

2177
01:15:44,200 --> 01:15:45,520
If it weren't his birthday,

2178
01:15:45,520 --> 01:15:46,720
I'd kick him.

2179
01:15:46,720 --> 01:15:47,280
You should

2180
01:15:47,280 --> 01:15:49,360
