from your big bro, okay?

2181
01:15:50,880 --> 01:15:52,320
Plant. The character
with "wood" and "straight".

2182
01:15:53,160 --> 01:15:53,600
No.

2183
01:15:53,740 --> 01:15:54,920
(What we know: Not edible, not a plant)

2184
01:15:54,920 --> 01:15:55,600
No?

2185
01:15:56,680 --> 01:15:58,520
We could ask if it's an object.

2186
01:15:58,920 --> 01:16:00,320
That's actually a good question.

2187
01:16:01,120 --> 01:16:01,680
Good question.

2188
01:16:01,880 --> 01:16:02,480
Bai,

2189
01:16:03,160 --> 01:16:04,400
is it an object?

2190
01:16:04,400 --> 01:16:05,120
Yes.

2191
01:16:05,120 --> 01:16:06,840
(Questions used: 3)
Because the game's literally called

2192
01:16:06,860 --> 01:16:08,280
Creative Object Guessing Game.

2193
01:16:08,280 --> 01:16:08,960
What?

2194
01:16:09,800 --> 01:16:10,520
Creative Object Guessing Game.

2195
01:16:10,580 --> 01:16:12,900
(The poor guy fell for it)

2196
01:16:13,040 --> 01:16:14,480
(Friends to your face)
That's actually a good question.

2197
01:16:14,480 --> 01:16:15,880
(Playing mind games behind your back)
The game's called

2198
01:16:15,880 --> 01:16:16,880
Creative Object Guessing Game.

2199
01:16:17,460 --> 01:16:18,820
(The more we ask, the less we know)

2200
01:16:20,080 --> 01:16:21,160
It's been two rounds.

2201
01:16:21,160 --> 01:16:22,240
Not one person has asked me anything.

2202
01:16:22,260 --> 01:16:23,380
(Can't stand being ignored)

2203
01:16:23,980 --> 01:16:25,700
(You know exactly why nobody asks you)

2204
01:16:26,280 --> 01:16:27,560
I'm gonna go eat.

2205
01:16:27,560 --> 01:16:28,940
(Guess I'll leave)

2206
01:16:29,320 --> 01:16:30,400
Is it Shen Teng?

2207
01:16:30,400 --> 01:16:32,080
That dumb question counts as five.

2208
01:16:33,640 --> 01:16:34,880
I'm ordering you to ask me one.

2209
01:16:34,880 --> 01:16:36,300
(Forced affection)

2210
01:16:36,520 --> 01:16:38,200
Teng, a household appliance?

2211
01:16:38,200 --> 01:16:39,860
(Questions used: 4)

2212
01:16:40,040 --> 01:16:40,840
Teng isn't one.

2213
01:16:41,240 --> 01:16:43,040
I knew it.

2214
01:16:45,000 --> 01:16:46,720
Teng, stop it. Behave yourself.

2215
01:16:48,120 --> 01:16:50,440
Is it a household appliance?

2216
01:16:51,440 --> 01:16:52,240
I already said no.

2217
01:16:52,760 --> 01:16:53,200
No?

2218
01:16:53,200 --> 01:16:54,240
(What we know: Not edible,
not a plant, not an appliance)

2219
01:16:54,240 --> 01:16:55,760
Is it someone sitting here?

2220
01:16:57,120 --> 01:16:58,440
We're guessing an object!

2221
01:16:59,720 --> 01:17:01,200
It's not alive!

2222
01:17:03,800 --> 01:17:04,520
An object.

2223
01:17:07,800 --> 01:17:08,720
Not a plant.

2224
01:17:08,720 --> 01:17:10,240
(Putting the clues together)
Not alive.

2225
01:17:10,240 --> 01:17:11,200
Not a household appliance.

2226
01:17:12,480 --> 01:17:15,040
Do they have

2227
01:17:15,040 --> 01:17:16,300
(Being way too cautious)
an undercover on their team?

2228
01:17:18,000 --> 01:17:18,880
Who could possibly guess this?

2229
01:17:18,880 --> 01:17:20,360
I don't care which
of us four is the undercover.

2230
01:17:20,360 --> 01:17:21,240
Could you

2231
01:17:23,640 --> 01:17:24,960
give us another hint?

2232
01:17:25,960 --> 01:17:26,960
We're totally lost.

2233
01:17:26,960 --> 01:17:28,080
We haven't even figured out

2234
01:17:28,080 --> 01:17:28,920
the general category.

2235
01:17:31,920 --> 01:17:33,240
Right now, I wish someone

2236
01:17:33,240 --> 01:17:35,040
would just take my ribs away.

2237
01:17:40,700 --> 01:17:42,860
(Firecrackers, Undercover: Song Yaxuan)

2238
01:17:45,980 --> 01:17:47,740
(Secret Signal:
Setting off firecrackers)

2239
01:17:47,800 --> 01:17:48,320
Bai,

2240
01:17:49,320 --> 01:17:50,800
has it appeared
during these two days of filming?

2241
01:17:52,000 --> 01:17:53,840
(Questions used: 5)
That's a really good question.

2242
01:17:53,840 --> 01:17:57,120
(Firecrackers, Undercover: Song Yaxuan)

2243
01:17:57,120 --> 01:17:58,440
Yes and no.

2244
01:17:58,440 --> 01:17:59,360
Be more specific.

2245
01:17:59,360 --> 01:18:00,720
Has it appeared?

2246
01:18:00,720 --> 01:18:01,200
Right?

2247
01:18:01,200 --> 01:18:02,700
(No actual firecrackers have appeared)

2248
01:18:02,960 --> 01:18:04,280
Yes and no?

2249
01:18:04,760 --> 01:18:06,240
You shouldn't have asked that.

2250
01:18:06,240 --> 01:18:07,440
(Things just got even worse)

2251
01:18:07,440 --> 01:18:08,880
Who was it again?

2252
01:18:08,880 --> 01:18:10,280
Which one of us four?

2253
01:18:10,340 --> 01:18:11,940
(No way to give them a hint)

2254
01:18:12,760 --> 01:18:13,520
Who?

2255
01:18:15,000 --> 01:18:16,160
Did they forget

2256
01:18:16,160 --> 01:18:18,000
to show the undercover the card?

2257
01:18:20,800 --> 01:18:22,800
At this point, I think the undercover

2258
01:18:22,800 --> 01:18:24,160
should just stay hidden.

2259
01:18:24,640 --> 01:18:26,800
(Good point)
They'll never figure out who it is.

2260
01:18:26,800 --> 01:18:27,280
Exactly.

2261
01:18:27,280 --> 01:18:28,800
I don't have a clue either.

2262
01:18:33,520 --> 01:18:34,560
What even is this thing?

2263
01:18:34,560 --> 01:18:35,400
We're totally lost.

2264
01:18:35,460 --> 01:18:37,600
(What other hints can I give?)

2265
01:18:37,600 --> 01:18:38,800
Let Song ask another question.

2266
01:18:38,800 --> 01:18:40,200
Let's see what else he comes up with.

2267
01:18:41,420 --> 01:18:43,460
(A game we played together)

2268
01:18:44,200 --> 01:18:45,160
Is it a game?

2269
01:18:45,160 --> 01:18:46,060
(One more try)

2270
01:18:46,780 --> 01:18:50,860
(Does anyone get it?)

2271
01:18:53,040 --> 01:18:54,280
An object!

2272
01:18:54,760 --> 01:18:56,360
What's wrong with you?

2273
01:18:56,360 --> 01:18:58,580
(Nobody gets me)
A game is an object too.

2274
01:18:58,600 --> 01:18:59,800
I'll just tell you the answer.

2275
01:18:59,800 --> 01:19:00,520
A boil.

2276
01:19:01,360 --> 01:19:02,320
A boil?

2277
01:19:05,760 --> 01:19:06,160
Hard to guide them.

2278
01:19:06,160 --> 01:19:07,600
Seriously, it's tough.

2279
01:19:08,400 --> 01:19:09,160
For example,

2280
01:19:09,160 --> 01:19:09,680
would...

2281
01:19:10,400 --> 01:19:12,400
(Let me teach you how to be a undercover)
Would it appear during Chinese New Year?

2282
01:19:12,400 --> 01:19:13,880
(Questions used: 6)
Don't tell me it's firecrackers.

2283
01:19:14,320 --> 01:19:14,800
Yes.

2284
01:19:14,800 --> 01:19:15,760
(Questions used: 7)
It's firecrackers.

2285
01:19:15,760 --> 01:19:18,120
What if we'd asked
whether it's allowed on a plane?

2286
01:19:19,140 --> 01:19:20,400
(Too late now)

2287
01:19:20,400 --> 01:19:22,120
Just let us guess the undercover.

2288
01:19:22,120 --> 01:19:23,040
I can't take this anymore.

2289
01:19:23,040 --> 01:19:23,800
(Excited)
I think I know

2290
01:19:23,800 --> 01:19:24,640
who the undercover is now.

2291
01:19:26,740 --> 01:19:28,300
(Who's the undercover?)

2292
01:19:28,600 --> 01:19:29,920
It's probably Song.

2293
01:19:29,920 --> 01:19:30,320
Song.

2294
01:19:30,540 --> 01:19:31,500
(Undercover: Song Yaxuan)

2295
01:19:31,500 --> 01:19:33,380
(All hope is lost)

2296
01:19:33,560 --> 01:19:34,320
Bing.

2297
01:19:34,800 --> 01:19:35,560
No way.

2298
01:19:35,860 --> 01:19:36,820
(Another plot twist?)

2299
01:19:39,100 --> 01:19:41,060
(Hope is restored)

2300
01:19:41,120 --> 01:19:43,880
(Undercover: Song Yaxuan)
Who kept helping them sort things out

2301
01:19:43,880 --> 01:19:44,840
and organize the clues?

2302
01:19:44,840 --> 01:19:45,760
Bing.

2303
01:19:45,760 --> 01:19:47,640
Who kept patiently reminding them

2304
01:19:47,640 --> 01:19:50,040
what they'd already asked?

2305
01:19:50,040 --> 01:19:50,800
Bing.

2306
01:19:51,240 --> 01:19:53,400
Who covered his face
and said he couldn't figure it out?

2307
01:19:53,400 --> 01:19:54,120
Bing again.

2308
01:19:54,680 --> 01:19:55,880
My vote's for Bing.

2309
01:19:55,880 --> 01:19:56,840
Confidence.

2310
01:19:57,240 --> 01:19:58,800
Show us your confident side.

2311
01:20:01,480 --> 01:20:02,680
Jia Bing, is it you?

2312
01:20:03,880 --> 01:20:04,280
No.

2313
01:20:04,280 --> 01:20:04,820
(Undercover: Jia Bing)

2314
01:20:04,940 --> 01:20:06,780
(Lost half his dignity)

2315
01:20:07,480 --> 01:20:08,480
Switch sides.

2316
01:20:10,200 --> 01:20:12,280
Switch sides and ask again, right?

2317
01:20:18,000 --> 01:20:18,920
Could it be you, Song?

2318
01:20:21,320 --> 01:20:22,120
Is it firecrackers?

2319
01:20:22,140 --> 01:20:23,820
(Neither one's backing down)

2320
01:20:26,280 --> 01:20:28,600
You didn't give us any hints.

2321
01:20:28,600 --> 01:20:29,960
It was so hard to hint.

2322
01:20:29,960 --> 01:20:31,000
This was too hard.

2323
01:20:31,000 --> 01:20:31,800
At the end, he said

2324
01:20:31,800 --> 01:20:33,640
